vocab:Bioeconomy a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:source <https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cover_crop_in_field_-_geograph.org.uk_-_5236028.jpg> ;
    skos:definition "Producing and using renewable biological resources, including crops, biomass and residues, for food, materials, energy or other products instead of relying solely on fossil resources."@en,
        "Het produceren en benutten van hernieuwbare biologische hulpbronnen, zoals gewassen, biomassa en reststromen, voor voedsel, materialen, energie of andere producten als alternatief voor fossiele grondstoffen."@nl ;
    skos:editorialNote "Bilingual definition drafted for the PoC; requires validation by ReGeNL domain experts. Previous source definitions are retained in regenlmeta:originalDefinition."@en ;
