    dcterms:source <https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Farm_Office.jpg> ;
    skos:definition "Planning acquisition, maintenance, use and replacement of farm infrastructure, buildings, machinery and tools to support efficient and responsible operations."@en,
